    "title": "Write a practical message",
    "subtitle": "A tool behaves unexpectedly · 1 · preparation 1",
    "context": "Use this subset of the technology vocabulary and constructions in a short self-contained situation, preparing for U5-30. Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to describe a technical problem, compare explanations and choose a next step.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U5-30-P01-compose-produce",
